From 9086e89b935cb3b762711a40e0a6d96b2b0971a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marc Lainez <marc.lainez@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:51:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] board: qualcomm: add Fairphone 3 / 3+

U-Boot runs from the boot partition, chainloaded by the stock LK, with
its console on the boot splash. It boots a standard boot method from
eMMC or, like lk2nd, an image with its own partition table in userdata.
Volume Up opens a boot menu with USB disk (userdata only), fastboot and
serial console modes, Volume Down starts USB fastboot.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
